<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>라벨</title>
    <style>
      @page {
        size: <%= labelSize === 'large' ? '100mm 100mm' : labelSize === 'medium' ? '80mm 60mm' : '50mm 30mm' %>;
        margin: 0;
      }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        font-family: 'Nanum Gothic', sans-serif;
        height: 100%;
      }
      .label-content {
              width: 100%;
              height: 100%;
              justify-content: center; /* 수평 중앙 */
              align-items: center;     /* 수직 중앙 */
              text-align: center;
            }
      h1, h2, p {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      /* ---------- Large 전용 스타일 ---------- */
      .label-large {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-size: 9pt;
      line-height: 1.4;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .large-top {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .large-title {
      font-size: 16pt;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .frozen-badge {
      border: 1.5px solid #000;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 4px;
      width: 60px;
      height: 60px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 7pt;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .frozen-badge svg {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 2px;
    }

    .large-info p {
      margin: 2px 0;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .large-bottom {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-end;
    }
    .barcode-box {
      text-align: center;
    }
    .barcode-box img {
      width: 140px;
      height: auto;
    }
    .date-box {
      text-align: left;
      font-size: 10pt;
    }
    .microwave-box {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 8pt;
    }
    .microwave-box svg {
      display: block;
      width: 42px;
      height: 28px;
      margin: 0 auto 2px auto;
    }

      /* ---------- Medium 전용 스타일 ---------- */
      .label-medium {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: flex-start;
        height: 100%;
        padding: 8px;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        text-align: left;
      }
      .medium-header {
        font-size: 14pt;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }
      .medium-info {
        font-size: 8pt;
        line-height: 1.4;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
      }
      h5 {
                    transform: rotate(270deg); /* 90도 회전 */
                    transform-origin: center center; /* 회전 중심점 지정 (기본값) */
                  }
      .small-label {
                    display: flex;
                    flex-flow: column;
                  }
                  .small-label-container {
                    display: flex;
                    flex-flow: column;
                  }
      .small-label-barcode {
        margin-top: 1rem;
        display: flex;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="label-content">
      <% if (labelSize === 'large') { %>
        <div class="label-large">
    <!-- 상단: 제품명 + 냉동 배지 -->
    <div class="large-top">
      <div class="large-title"><%= productName %></div>
      <div class="frozen-badge">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" stroke="#000" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M32 8v48M8 32h48M16 16l32 32M48 16L16 48"/>
        </svg>
        냉동식품
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 본문 -->
    <div class="large-info">
      <p>등록번호: 제IIIRAX0009호 / 제품명: <%= productName %></p>
      <p>종류 및 형태: 단미사료 / 혼합성-혼합제 / 큐브</p>
      <p>성분량: 조단백질 36% 이상, 조지방 25% 이하, 조회분 5% 이하, 조섬유 5% 이하, 수분 10% 이하</p>
      <p>원료의 명칭: 쌀, 계란, 두부, 브로콜리, 당근, 닭가슴살, 단호박, 코코넛오일</p>
      <p>실제중량: 50g</p>
      <p>사료의 용도: 애완동물용</p>
      <p>제조일자: 유통기한으로부터 12개월 전</p>
      <p>주의사항: 반려동물 이외에는 급여하지 마십시오.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- 하단: 바코드 + 날짜 + 전자레인지 -->
    <div class="large-bottom">
      <div class="barcode-box">
        <img src="data:image/png;base64,<%= barcodeBase64 %>" alt="Barcode" />
        <div>8 800278 470831</div>
      </div>
      <div class="date-box">
        <p>제조일자: <%= manufactureDate %></p>
        <p>유통기한: <%= expiryDate %></p>
        <p>제품수량: 10개</p>
      </div>
      <div class="microwave-box">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 64 48" fill="none" stroke="#000" stroke-width="2">
          <rect x="2" y="8" width="52" height="32" rx="2"/>
          <circle cx="58" cy="16" r="2"/>
          <circle cx="58" cy="24" r="2"/>
          <circle cx="58" cy="32" r="2"/>
        </svg>
        30초~2분
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

      <% } else if (labelSize === 'medium') { %>
      <div class="label-medium">
        <h2 class="medium-header"><%= productName %></h2>
        <p class="medium-info">
          등록번호: 제IIIRAX0009호 / 제품명: 댕치킨<br />
          종류 및 현태: 단미사료 / 혼합성-혼합제 / 큐브<br />
          성분량: 조단백질 36% 이상
        </p>
        <p class="medium-info">제조일자: <%= manufactureDate %></p>
        <p class="medium-info">유통기한: <%= expiryDate %></p>
        <p class="medium-info">제품수량: 1개</p>
      </div>

      <% } else if (labelSize === 'small') { %>
      <div class="small-label-container">
        <div class="small-lable">
          <p>제 조 날 짜</p>
          <p><%= manufactureDate.split('').join(' ') %></p>
        </div>
        <div class="small-lable">
          <p>유 통 기 한</p>
          <p><%= expiryDate.split('').join(' ') %></p>
        </div>
        <div class="small-label-barcode">
          <h5><%= productName %></h5>
          <img
            class="barcode"
            src="data:image/png;base64,<%= barcodeBase64 %>"
            alt="Barcode"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
      <% } %>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
